#: ../../whatsnew/3.12.rst:200
msgid ""
"In addition, the PEP introduces a new way to declare :ref:`type aliases "
"<type-aliases>` using the :keyword:`type` statement, which creates an "
"instance of :class:`~typing.TypeAliasType`::"
msgstr ""
