msgid ""
":mod:`datetime`: :class:`datetime.datetime`'s "
":meth:`~datetime.datetime.utcnow` and "
":meth:`~datetime.datetime.utcfromtimestamp` are deprecated and will be "
"removed in a future version. Instead, use timezone-aware objects to "
"represent datetimes in UTC: respectively, call "
":meth:`~datetime.datetime.now` and :meth:`~datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp`"
"  with the *tz* parameter set to :const:`datetime.UTC`. (Contributed by Paul"
" Ganssle in :gh:`103857`.)"
msgstr ""
":mod:`datetime`: Metody :meth:`~datetime.datetime.utcnow` a "
":meth:`~datetime.datetime.utcfromtimestamp` třídy :class:`datetime.datetime`"
" jsou zastaralé a budou odebrány v budoucí verzi. Místo toho použijte "
"objekty znalé způsoby k reprezentaci časových okamžiků v UTC: v souladu s "
"tím volájte :meth:`~datetime.datetime.now` a "
":meth:`~datetime.datetime.fromtimestamp` s parametrem *tz* nastaveným na "
":const:`datetime.UTC`. (Přispěl Paul Ganssle v :gh:`103857`.)"

