"Autoconf 2.71 and aclocal 1.16.4 is now required to regenerate "
":file:`configure`. (Contributed by Christian Heimes in :gh:`89886`.)"
msgstr ""
"Autoconf 2.71 a aclocal 1.16.4 jsou nyní vyžadovány pro regeneraci "
